---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="EPC Edinburgh Appointments | Scotland EPC"
  description="Arrange an Edinburgh EPC (RdSAP) assessment with Scotland EPC. Get a clear quote, choose a convenient slot, and receive your certificate quickly."
  canonicalPath="/epc-edinburgh"
>
  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="container-pro max-w-4xl space-y-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900">EPC (RdSAP) Assessments in Edinburgh</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-700">Scotland EPC helps landlords, homeowners and letting agents across Edinburgh book EPC assessments with less admin and clear communication from start to finish.</p>
      <div class="quote-card space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Suitable for common property types</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-slate-700 space-y-1">
          <li>Flats, houses, bungalows, and maisonettes.</li>
          <li>Single properties or multiple bookings in one request.</li>
          <li>Optional Legionella assessment alongside EPC where needed.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-700">Use the <a class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900" href="/#quote">online quote form</a> to request your preferred date, or return to the <a class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900" href="/">Scotland EPC homepage</a>.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-700">Need a related service? Visit <a class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900" href="/legionella-risk-assessment-edinburgh">Legionella risk assessments in Edinburgh</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
